  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Destruction sphere (Energy Leap (blast shape), Explosive Orb (blast shape)).</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you end your movement when using Energy Leap, you may choose to also deal your destructive blast damage in a burst centered on your square with a 5-foot radius, + 5 feet per 10 caster levels. Creatures that take damage from your energy leap do not suffer additional damage from the burst.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/combat-feats#toc33\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
